      "media_type": "IMAGE",
      "creative_text": "We believe innovation starts in the field, with growers like you who push boundaries every day. \n\nThat’s where the story of Cazado® began. Faced with the growing challenge of wild oat resistance, the ADAMA Canada team set out to create a solution that would help growers protect their crops without compromise.\n\nThrough countless field walks, honest conversations, and years of trial work, we built something that reflects the way growers innovate every day: by listening, learning, and delivering—together.\n\nOur latest blog shares how Cazado® was brought to life through Value Innovation, a process rooted in real grower insight and collaboration across the field, lab, and globe.\n\n🔗 Read the full story and see how innovation starts where it matters most: in your fields.\n\nhttp://bit.ly/4oFFIuj\n\n#InsideValueInnovation",
